RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=3;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Belgium: ONSS/RSZ social security contributions payment (quarterly)
DESCRIPTION:The employer pays contributions quarterly. They must reach the 
 ONSS at the latest on the last day of the month following the quarter: 30 
 April\, 31 July\, 31 October and 31 January.\nApplies to: Employers regist
 ered with the ONSS/RSZ\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource:
  https://www.socialsecurity.be/employer/instructions/dmfa/fr/latest/instru
 ctions/obligations/obligations_nsso/contributionpayment_obligations_period
 icity/generalrule.html\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlin
 es.html#belgium\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates f
 ollow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are 
 not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#belgium
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:be-dmfa-quarterly@intelligentpayroll.eu
