DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=3;BYMONTHDAY=-1
SUMMARY:Belgium: DmfA quarterly social security declaration
DESCRIPTION:The employer (or its mandatary) files the DmfA with the ONSS in
  the month following the quarter: by 30 April\, 31 July\, 31 October and 3
 1 January.\nApplies to: Employers registered with the ONSS/RSZ\nNon-workin
 g-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.socialsecurity.be/emp
 loyer/instructions/dmfa/fr/latest/instructions/obligations/obligations_nss
 o/dmfa/general.html\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.
 html#belgium\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates foll
 ow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not
  applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#belgium
